        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoreng’anio bw’omosabibu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigaacha asende, riganteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, Inee, naki omote bw’omosabibu gose orosagia rw’aye robuete emete ende yonsi, ase ogotogigwa, ase egati y’emete ende ere ase rinani?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Omote oyio nonachwe okorerwe moremo onde? Gose abanto mbaroisie egekongo korwa ase omote oyio basungere egento kende gionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo okoba chinko orutwa riko. Ekero omorero osambire chinsinyo chiaye chionsi, na obogati bwaye bwarurirwe, Inee, bono moremo ki orakorerwe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naama! Onye ekero omosabibu oyio orenge omogima togwenerete gokorerwa moremo onde bwensi, bono ekero oyire na korurwa nomorero, ’moremo ki orakorerwe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ayio, aya naro Omonene agoteeba: Buna koreng’ana naruure omote bw’omosabibu ore ase egati y’emete ende ere ase rinani outerwe omorero oyie, naboigo ndatugute abanto ba Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo ndababee; nonya bagochia gotooreka korwa ase omorero, naende omorero n’oro orabasirie. Erio nario moramanye ng’a inche ninche Omonene, nababeeire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninsirie ense eyio ebe bosa, ekiagera bakorire aya atari ay’obwegenwa. Nabo Omonene ateebire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
